  "totalBlocks": 38,
  "translatedBlocks": 38,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3b72a466cd7c9df",
      "translationZh": "这将是有史以来最短的博客文章。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8f19e121a39d7c2",
      "translationZh": "问：Llama 3.2 两周前已在 Hugging Face / Transformers 上发布。什么时候能在 Keras 中使用？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30f2c7fa1a4d664b",
      "translationZh": "答：从第一天起就能用了 😀。没什么需要等的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73bb781c46ec7f0f",
      "translationZh": "没错，Keras Llama3 可以从任何标准的（即 safetensors 格式的）Hugging Face 检查点加载，包括 3.2 的检查点。如果需要转换，会即时完成。试试这个：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1beace47f828c35c",
      "translationZh": "这里有一个 Colab，可以动手试试。玩得开心！🤗",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df8e49a60f0c3d7a",
      "translationZh": "好吧，好吧，有人告诉我，如果想发表一篇博客文章，就得多写点内容来填满篇幅。下面再介绍几件关于 Keras 你需要知道的事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7a243b76e8a41e0d",
      "translationZh": "Keras 支持多后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76dd859f4c9c236f",
      "translationZh": "Keras 是面向 JAX、PyTorch 和 TensorFlow 的、久经考验的建模库。你可能已经注意到演示 Colab 中的这一行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80c606a71b199679",
      "translationZh": "它必须出现在 import keras 之前，用于控制模型是在 JAX、PyTorch 还是 TensorFlow 上运行。想借助 XLA 编译在 JAX 上试用你最喜欢的模型，这非常方便 🚀。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9b51e50e6fa41580",
      "translationZh": "什么是 keras-hub？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "713585f6b578fde8",
      "translationZh": "Keras 是一个建模库，而 keras-hub 是它的预训练模型集合。它之前名为 KerasNLP 和 KerasCV。更名工作正在进行中。它包含所有热门的预训练模型（Llama3、Gemma、StableDiffusion、Segment Anything 等），并提供这些模型在 Keras 中的标准实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "857d0b332478fb2f",
      "translationZh": "Keras 中的 LLM“开箱即用”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6078a49f7fc153f2",
      "translationZh": "我的意思是，“自带分词器”。model.generate() 可以直接处理字符串：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a71c99e74b0f090f",
      "translationZh": "训练也是如此。你可以直接用一组字符串进行训练：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fa9d694a27435959",
      "translationZh": "与 LLM 聊天",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95f64e41f76d52be",
      "translationZh": "热门 LLM 的指令微调变体可用于逐轮对话。在这里，Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct 能理解以下对话标记方式（参见 meta 文档）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ce67f057cd8f3b7",
      "translationZh": "对话按这种方式格式化后，就可以直接传给 model.generate()。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3952f6fd05c2522e",
      "translationZh": "为方便起见，演示用的 Colab 实现了一个名为 ChatState 的辅助类，可自动完成必要的字符串拼接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2abf6c44c5b14910",
      "translationZh": "更底层的访问：Tokenizer、Backbone",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a8075a55b78154d",
      "translationZh": "如果你不喜欢“开箱即用”的方式，而想直接使用底层的分词器和模型，也可以轻松访问它们：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8debc2f3797da271",
      "translationZh": "等等，Tokenizer、Preprocessor？我有点糊涂了",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53c641c577821b81",
      "translationZh": "Tokenizer 只是将文本转换为整数向量。这里的“Hello”会被转换为单个词元：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5cc2e753cf72fc4",
      "translationZh": "Preprocessor 是一个统括性概念，涵盖模型所需的所有数据变换。例如，对于涉及图像的任务，这可能包括图像尺寸调整或数据增强；对于文本模型，则可能是像这里这样的文本分词。对于 CausalLM 任务，预处理器还会处理另外三个细节：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c4729233b61fdc0",
      "translationZh": "添加模型所需的文本起始词元和文本结束词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71818182985bec8f",
      "translationZh": "对词元序列进行填充并生成掩码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c24511490d61f72d",
      "translationZh": "为训练和微调生成“预期输出”。对于 CausalLM 任务，预期输出就是移位一位后的输入字符串。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9d1aec1e6dcd3e8a",
      "translationZh": "Keras 内置了训练器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "962e8c0b89574f62",
      "translationZh": "只需对你的训练数据集调用 model.fit(ds)。这个训练器兼容 Keras 中可用的各种分布式训练、混合精度、量化或 LoRA/QLoRA 选项。它也完全是可选的。如果愿意，你可以编写自定义训练循环。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bc9bb14c9e1cbfd",
      "translationZh": "如需完整示例，请参阅演示 Colab，其中我们对 Llama 3.2 进行微调，让它像海盗一样说话：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bfd60335e5e23382",
      "translationZh": "你可以上传到 Hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b636cbde8a4f85f5",
      "translationZh": "当你对微调后的模型感到满意时，可以使用以下方式直接从 Keras 上传：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "194b96e6f0552e95",
      "translationZh": "上传的模型可以在这里查看。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "108bb35260ca80e7",
      "translationZh": "用于推理或训练的分布式模型并行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d2467f60344f4309",
      "translationZh": "本节的 Colab 演示：Llama 3.1 Keras 模型并行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46815ac673e7aa16",
      "translationZh": "你们当中有些人可能在想，既然已经可以在 Hugging Face 上使用 Transformers 来处理 LLM，为什么还要用 Keras？答案是：即使你不在乎 Keras 作为建模框架的灵活性和易用性（你应该在乎！），得益于 JAX 及其强大的 XLA 编译器，Keras 也是你实现高级模型并行的最快途径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75aa5a9226e11764",
      "translationZh": "我们选一个 8B 参数的模型来演示：meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct（Colab 演示在这里）。不做量化的话，这个模型太大，任何单个加速器都容纳不下。使用 Keras，你可以将它分片加载到多个 GPU 或 TPU 加速器上。如果你不确定怎样的权重分片才是“正确”的，大多数模型都提供了合理的默认设置。这里，调用 keras_hub.models.Llama3Backbone.get_layout_map(device_mesh)：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "526460a71e0f8bc0",
      "translationZh": "如果你不信任模型提供的默认布局映射，也可以自己定义。在这个运行于仅有 8 个核心的“小型” TPU 配置上的示例中，下面的布局映射比默认设置快一些（54 秒/轮，而不是 62 秒/轮）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "984d03104e9fa4d2",
      "translationZh": "看看这里的 Colab 演示，它在 Google TPU v5e 上用海盗腔对更大的 8B Llama 进行微调，耗时不到 8 分钟（可在 Hugging Face Spaces 的 JupyterLab 中使用。微调后的模型在这里。如果你需要一份关于模型并行和 Keras 的简短模型讲解，我也在这里为你准备好了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
